            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## 1.0.27

- Added manual task-status controls, including reopening failed work.
- A manual status change now notifies the task creator through NHI.
- Fixed the mascot's incoming-task counter to match the task board and keep failed tasks open.

]]></description>
